<title>USA: Main Street names Bisceglia COO.</title>
<headline>Main Street names Bisceglia COO.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX, Ariz. 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Main Street and Main Inc said Gerard Bisceglia joined the company as executive vice prsident and chief operating officer, effective immediately. In the new post, he will handle restaurant operations and marketing.</p>
<p>He previously servce as vice president of food service operations at Tosco Corp's Circle K division.</p>
